      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>period for Header is over (read only)</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>Analysis Restrictions</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>o SOD Matrix Version: Enter the SOD matrix version to use for the</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>analysis.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>o Count Users: This button can be selected to count the number of users</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>that will be analyzed from the &quot;User Restriction&quot; selection criteria</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>entered.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>o User Group: Specify the user group.  If left blank, the analysis will</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>run for all user groups.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>o User Type: Specify the user type.  If left blank, the analysis will</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>run for all user type.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>o Cost Center: Specify the Cost Center. If left blank, the analysis will</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>run for all Cost Centers.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>o Only Valid Users: Fill this checkbox if you would like to run this</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>analysis for currently valid (non-locked, non-expired) users only. If</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>checkbox is unchecked it will consider locked and expired users as well.</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>o Conflicts: Specify the SOD conflict IDs to run this analysis. If left</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>blank, the scan will run for all Conflicts.,,</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>Cross System/Remote options</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>,,o If systems other than the local system need to be included in the</TDLINE>
