      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>analysis, specify the RFC-Destinations here</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDFORMAT>*</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>,,o Only Analyze Remote Systems: don.t analyze the users on the Local</TDLINE>
