      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>you would like toanalyze the user and exclude from the analysis any</TDLINE>
      </TLINE>
      <TLINE>
       <TDLINE>emergency role accessthey have at the time the report is ran.</TDLINE>
